meta {
  name: Crop PDF - Manual Size
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
 url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pdf/cropPdf
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  user-username: {{username}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "url": "https://example.com/path/to/shipping-label.pdf",
    "targetWidthMm": 100,
    "targetHeightMm": 150,
    "autoCrop": false
  }
}

docs {
  Crop PDF dari URL ke ukuran tertentu.
  
  Mengambil PDF dari URL, lalu crop setiap halaman ke dimensi target.
  Content di-crop dari top-left halaman (posisi umum label pengiriman).
  
  Response: application/pdf (binary).
  
  Use case: Label pengiriman marketplace (TikTokShop, Tokopedia, Shopee)
  yang di-generate di halaman A4 tapi isi label hanya di bagian atas.
}
